  "caveats": [
    "sourceRows preserves the replacement-parts export, not a claim that 557 physical pieces are simultaneously supplied. Replacement/mold alternatives can be separate rows.",
    "Examples of alternatives: blue 3L friction pins element4514553/6299413; wheel6253244/6460453; gray pin4211865/6321747; clear dish6220743/6507944. Do not sum alternatives into availability.",
    "LEGO design IDs, BrickLink part IDs and LDraw filenames use different namespaces. curatedBuildParts explicitly maps selected structural parts using both catalogs.",
    "The 2019 LEGO overview sheet lists lower quantities for some parts; this record is the later customer-services/base-set catalog snapshot, not a specific physical kit revision.",
    "curatedBuildParts is a verified subset for construction planning. Unlisted parts are not forbidden; consult sourceRows and catalog identity before use.",
    "Catalog masses are reference part measurements, not weighed specimens. Pin2780 has mold variants: the source lists0.20g for no-center-slot variants and about0.15g with center slots.",
    "Electrical cables are part of electronic assembly masses; do not add cable mass twice. Hub and battery are separate sourceRows.",
    "Keep source text encoding as received; a few upstream element names contain legacy mojibake."
  ],
